              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "- Nimetoa na ya kila siku nipate uzima wa milele",
                "- Ni metoa na ya upendo",
                "- Ni metoa na ya haadi Naomboleza mimi nipate raha, bwana unirehumu baba ninyakuwe mbinguni, uniteuwe bwana nipate kuku Hudumia. Nauzunika mimi nipate uzima.",
                "Bwana ni metoa vitu viangu viote ni vya bure via nikosesha uzima sita virudia tena."
